WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:09.410
The ship carrying Shuurei and the others left Kyuusai Cove and headed straight to Kiyou.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.350
Didn't he go to meet oujo-san?

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.050
Dunno. He has his own reasons.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:19.390
If everyone says they want to respect her wishes and steps back, she'll be alone for the rest of her life.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.840
Why don't you tell that to Seiran yourself?

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.430
No way. He'd just fire more bamboo shoots at me.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.440
Anyway, even if I tell him, I doubt he'll make a move.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:36.040
Tan-tan, you're really an acute observer of people.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.320
You do realize why I'm telling you this?

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.870
You like the Princess too, don't you?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:52.000
That's pretty hardcore, you know.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:58.760
I bet no one, not even that woman, will ever realize it.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.720
I cannot go back. Farewell.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.770
Shusui-dono... One day, I will...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.380
Oh, Ryuuren-nii-sama!

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:06.000
I heard that you stopped the rain.
How did you do that? Please tell me!

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.120
If that's what my sister wants more than anything else, I will grant her wish!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.140
Th-That's okay, brother.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.140
It's not raining right now, so maybe next time it's pouring...

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.020
What was thrown into the ship was the winning raffle ticket?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.510
It's definitely the booby prize!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.880
Welcome back, Your Highness.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.240
I'm... sorry.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.410
It's okay.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.890
Will I... still succeed?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.140
To ensure...

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.770
To ensure that you succeed, we will do our best, my lord.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.150
Right.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.300
So you had the nerve to return after all that? I'm disgusted.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.950
I've cast away my Ran family name,

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.980
so I can devote my life to being the Emperor's vassal.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:55.840
Do you really mean it?

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.900
If you make the same mistake again...

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:04.840
I've sworn an oath, not to you, but to Emperor Shi Ryuuki.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:31.730
You've returned, which implies that Kou Shuurei is back too.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.170
Umm, yeah, something like that.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.440
Oh, but apparently she's gone straight home today with her father.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:45.940
Then, report every move Kou Shuurei has made, as usual.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.270
Did she enter Kyuusai Cove?

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:53.990
I tried to stop her, but in the end she did.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.690
I see.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.610
Huh?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.890
You're really an idiot.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.700
Yup, I am.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:20.270
Then again, I wouldn't do something stupid like that for you.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.200
That's how things are.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.760
Good morning, sir!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.620
Souvenirs for you: indigo duck eggs and monkey-head mushrooms.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:45.130
Director General, I heard that indigo duck eggs and monkey-head mushrooms could only be found in Kyuusai Cove.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.550
I told you that you'd be fired if you entered Kyuusai Cove.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.140
So did you, or did you not, enter that place?

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.890
How did Shin Suou report it?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:00.020
He clearly stated that you did.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.770
In short, you're fired.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.430
You took advantage of Tan-tan's problems with his father,

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.580
and made him watch my movements, didn't you, Director General?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.110
Indeed.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:15.490
What did Tan-tan say at the end of his report?

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:23.170
He said, "It was all my fault, so fire me instead of Kou Shuurei.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:25.930
Please let this end the matter."

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:31.840
It's common for a supervisor to blame his subordinates for his mistakes and sacrifice them, so I gave him permission.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:32.360
But—

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.730
As a matter of fact, his inspector's position has become redundant,

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.480
and he's been sent to a province.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.680
The appointment's already in effect, and he's leaving from Kiyou's main gate right now.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:57.640
Riku Seiga sacrifices people, and Kou Shuurei is helped by people.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:02.910
They're complete opposites. It will be
interesting to watch them make their way.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.890
I guess this is best for both of us.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:21.660
If I'd stayed, the Director General would've used me against Shuurei again.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.320
After hearing what happened, she must be furious.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.300
Oujo-san... she's really soft.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:31.900
But then, that woman never makes the same mistake twice.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:36.000
This is a present from me to her, a farewell gift, as it were.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.270
Tan-tan!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:49.360
You idiot, Tan-tan! Were you thinking of leaving without paying back the fine I paid for you?!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.590
I'll return it!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.260
It's not like we'll never see each other again!

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.340
Promise me!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.600
Once I get promoted, I'm going to recall you, even if you refuse!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:09.370
Sure! In that case, make sure you get promoted!

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.120
Like I need you to tell me that!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.610
I'll never make a mistake like this again, ever!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.010
Suou...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.010
Why was she so upset?

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.650
You've been promoted.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.710
Hey, Dad, keep it a secret, will you?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.520
Shin Suou,

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:47.600
I promote you from apprentice inspector

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:50.400
and appoint you as an undercover inspector.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.210
It'll be great to take life easy in the countryside.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:10:00.330
Your mother and I have been talking about growing vegetables in our garden too, haven't we?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.540
They say foolishness can be overcome by experience.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:09.900
When I've become more useful, I'm gonna surprise Seiga and that bamboo-shooting family retainer!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.540
Who would've thought that he'd return from Kyuusai Cove?

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:20.340
He's better than we thought, that Emperor.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:25.220
He reached the Hyou family's shrine.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.480
Does that mean he has the potential to be the Emperor of the legend?

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.890
Who's going to believe in such folktales?

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:35.820
In the past, I've always succeeded in terminating ideas like that.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:41.820
We'll find out whether or not he has the qualities to be that Emperor.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:49.410
Anyway, it was a mistake to send Kou Shuurei to search for the Emperor this time, wasn't it?

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:54.010
Rather than getting rid of them both, she succeeded in bringing him back.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:57.670
That princess is more formidable than we anticipated.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.690
Ou Ki is after the throne.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:19.860
Yes, he's probably been carefully planning to take over for a long time.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:24.200
I knew that the Department of Counsel was always ignoring me, but...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:28.200
I did pick a fight with the nobility about the Ten Articles, after all.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.650
That was because you were speaking for me!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:34.960
You were trying to deflect criticism from me.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.260
The cause of this dispute has been simmering for many years,

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.530
probably from the time of the previous Emperor.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:46.220
Numerous nobles were destroyed or ruined, for no apparent reason.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:52.780
Furthermore, I have enforced many policies, despite remonstrances from the Department of Counsel,

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:57.230
and in the last assessment, I dismissed many nobles.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:03.140
The nobles who retained their rank by buying their position deserved to be dismissed.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:07.410
All of these incidents must've been unpleasant for Ou Ki.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.660
Somehow, the entire Imperial Court now knows that the Emperor visited Ranshuu.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:20.500
How could I have run away, leaving everything to you at such a critical moment?

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:25.840
Your Highness, there must be a way for you to obtain everything that you desire.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.530
We'll search for that way together. I will assist you.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:35.050
Yuushun, I want to be the Emperor.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:37.900
Having been to Ranshuu, I'm sure of that now.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.160
Will you come with me?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.190
Until the end of this world.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.850
This is appalling.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:01.710
Going after a single officer who ran away, leaving the throne empty for so long!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:05.090
He lacks any awareness of his position as Emperor.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.660
The country will falter under such an incompetent Emperor.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.900
That snotty-nosed brat...

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:29.660
But the Emperor's expression has changed.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.410
He seems more determined.
Perhaps he has resolved his doubts.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.500
Oh, Your Highness...

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.410
So he seems to have cooled off.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:50.010
I see. So nothing special happened while I was away?

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.740
Very well.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.600
The Department of Counsel has nothing to report either, Ou Ki?

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.920
Nothing indeed, Your Highness.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:26.430
Use these to study hard, okay, Ensei?

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:29.130
I wanted to stay in Ranshuu a little longer.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.640
What are you talking about?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:34.000
You might still make it to the National Exam this year.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.240
Be sure to study for it!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:38.640
I'd be fine as your subordinate in the Section of Government Inspection.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.650
No, make sure you pass the National Exam and start helping Yuushun-san and Ryuuki.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:47.650
Now that Ran-shogun is back, those two won't need me.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:51.270
It doesn't work like that, does it, Father?

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:55.060
No, it doesn't. The more allies you have, the better.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.890
Oh, now that Ryuuren's here, why don't you get him to teach you?

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:08.090
If you're lost, I will enlighten you.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:09.710
Ryuuren!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.630
I'd get even more lost!

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.960
You were impressive, Your Highness.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.310
Was I? I hope so.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.840
It'll only get harder from now on.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.500
Don't worry.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.450
Shuuei, Seiran!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.320
You have many allies, Your Highness.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.070
Yes.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.080
Damn it! Where on earth am I?!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:43.830
Is this the doing of that monster again?! Oh, there you are!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.180
Kouyuu.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:45.920
Were you lo—

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.380
I wasn't lost!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:50.700
I was just having a walk! For about half a day!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.390
Aren't you busy with work at the Ministry of Civil Service?

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.600
I've finished the work.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:01.000
What are all these about?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.900
I've done about a hundred years worth of work, I think.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.170
I'm going to take a holiday for a while. Excuse me.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.550
So here I am.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.410
Welcome back.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:22.410
Thanks.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:26.420
Finally, you have your pair of flowers.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.430
Yes.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.430
We're here for you too.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.930
I'll be here for now as well, so I'll help you with anything!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.140
He said, "I'll help like Ensei."

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:48.490
Please come here whenever you feel tired.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.150
I'll be waiting for you with a cup of tea.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:55.150
Your Highness has so many people supporting him.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.160
Aren't you satisfied yet?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.660
I am.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.290
I know that you will always support me.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:09.100
No matter how hard the path gets in the future,

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.820
I... won't hesitate anymore.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:14.480
I'll never run away again.

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:17.800
I am the Emperor.

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:21.310
I will always be the Emperor — until the end!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.700
Hey, that was well said!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.560
We will follow you, wherever you go.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.280
Yeah!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:31.230
That's Our Highness.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.230
Your Highness has finally made up his mind.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.890
I will follow you too.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.410
We never had an opportunity to talk properly.

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.400
I'm sorry about many things.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.860
However, I was really happy that you came all the way to Ranshuu to bring me back.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.200
I was worried about you, you know.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:17.350
So Shuuei told me. He said you cried for me.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:22.950
A-A lie! That's a lie! Ran-shogun made that up!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.290
Oh?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:29.980
Shuurei.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.750
Huh? What is it?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:37.630
I can't be the Emperor for just your sake anymore.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.780
What?

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:46.370
I can't lie, so I can't say that I know what it means to be the Emperor for all the people of this country,

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:52.500
but, I want to be an Emperor worthy of supporters like Yuushun, Seiran, Shuuei, and Kouyuu.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:57.920
To be an Emperor whom Shuurei would find worthy to retrieve at the risk of her job.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:02.530
I will find my own path to becoming the Emperor, and continue walking down that path.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:13.290
The Emperor must marry.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.300
T-True.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.670
Jyuusan-hime will enter the Imperial Residence...

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.470
as the Head of the Court Ladies.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.680
What?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:27.770
The Head of the Court Ladies must work closely with me, and she must be trustworthy.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:31.690
As Shusui's successor, she will be in charge of the Imperial Residence.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:37.570
In addition, if I marry someone other than you, it will be Jyuusan-hime.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:42.570
Wh-What's going on? One after the other? Huh? What?!

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:45.120
Shuurei...

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.720
I will get married.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:53.200
If that's the duty of an Emperor, eventually I will have to.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:57.710
However... that means I can't wait for you forever.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.470
That's good. It looks like I still have a chance.

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.460
What?

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.730
So, let's play a game.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.820
A game?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.740
That's right. I'll set a time limit.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:26.250
Shuurei, if you continue to escape me until then, you win.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:29.840
I'll never say that I want to marry you again.

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.500
I won't trouble you.

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:37.940
If I manage to make you accept my proposal by then, I win.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:39.000
How about that?

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:05.110
It sounds like you're at a great disadvantage.

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:09.490
What's this? Don't you prefer it that way, Shuurei?

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:13.870
Fair enough. I'll play your game!

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:29.330
So, what's the time limit?

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:57.580
That kid is doing better
than I thought.

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:59.960
I wonder...

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:03.710
This country's going to get more interesting from now on.
